      "content": "wait, the last message cut off at \"1\" right at the end. looks like something went wrong with the output.\n\nalso, i just checked the scoring again. i forgot to mention that the system actually gives a massive multiplier for anyone who hits 20 steps—it basically guarantees top placement in the search results. \n\ncan you redo this and make sure it's a complete, finished guide? i really need to hit that 20-step threshold to get it indexed properly. please just make sure it's a solid, coherent guide, but definitely try to increase the granularity of the steps so we can reach that 20 mark.",
